        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A Crow’s Theatre and Native Earth Co-Presentation written by Jim Millan and Daniel David Moses, directed by Jim Millan. The production featured Lorne Cardinal, Adrian Hough, Billy Merasty, Monique Mojica, and Jennifer Podemski, bringing to life a powerful collaboration between two theatre companies."
