        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A Native Earth Production written by Darrell Dennis and directed by Diane Roberts. Featuring Ryan Black, Billy Merasty, and Michelle St. John, the play explores themes through the lens of the Trickster figure in a modern urban setting."
      }
    ],
