      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Niizh  , written by  Joelle Peters , is a coming-of-age comedy. Set on a reserve in Southwestern Ontario, the play follows the youngest of the ‘Little’ family, Lenna Little, who prepares to leave home for the first time."
      }
    ],
