      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Written and performed by Jacob Boehme, Blood on the Dance Floor is a bold and unflinching autobiographical work that explores the artist’s experience as a gay Aboriginal man living with HIV. This Ilbijerri Theatre Company production, directed by Isaac Drandic, combines dance, theatre, and storytelli"
      }
