      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Created and directed by Tara Beagan, In Spirit (formerly Quilchena) is a haunting solo performance featuring Sera‑Lys McArthur. The story unfolds from the perspective of a young girl who goes missing after receiving a bicycle for her birthday in spring 1979. Years later, her remains are identified—b"
