      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Choreographed by Michael Greyeyes and written by Yvette Nolan, with music composed by Miquelon Rodriguez, from thine eyes is a haunting and meditative dance-theatre piece. Featuring performers including Michael Caldwell, Luke Garwood, Ceinwen Gobert, Sean Ling, Shannon Litzenberger, and Claudia Moor"
      }
