      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A Native Earth Production written by Patti Flather and Leonard Linklater, directed by Vinetta Strombergs, and featuring Columpa C. Bobb, Lorne Cardinal, Gilbert Clements, Carol Greyeyes, and Kevin Pelletier. The production was nominated for the 1997 Dora Mavor Moore Award in several categories, incl"
