      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "An Intervention is a contemporary two-hander by British playwright Mike Bartlett that premiered in 2014. It’s a sharp, funny and emotionally charged play about the strain on friendship when two people’s values and life choices collide. The story follows two friends as their arguments unfold across a"
      }
